License: bundled
 Each bundled component is under its own license, as listed in
 /usr/share/doc/incant/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md. These include permissive
 licenses (MIT, BSD, Apache-2.0, PSF-2.0 and others), weak copyleft
 (LGPL-2.1-or-later num2words; MPL-2.0 certifi and tqdm; tld under
 MPL-1.1 or GPL-2.0-only or LGPL-2.1-or-later) and strong copyleft (GPL-3.0
 mobi, phonemizer and espeak-ng via espeakng-loader). With the optional qa
 extra, PyAV's bundled FFmpeg build with libx264 and libx265
 (GPL-2.0-or-later) is included as well.
